{"title":"Bildbeschreibungen lesen","puid":"c-natdeu-3/9k49ek","path":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-01-saetze-lesen/level-06","type":"normal","keyboardLayout":"standardDE","voice":"m3","instruction":{"voice":"f5"},"voiceLang":"de","trainers":[{"trainer":"memory","instruction":{"text":"Welches Bild passt zu welchem Satz?","speaker":true},"chooseMode":"image","wideCards":true,"soundMode":"b","atoms":[{"a":"Sie leben in Afrika und haben einen Rüssel.","b":"die Elefanten","image":"adobe_264932515","sound":"die Elefanten"},{"a":"Er wohnt im Norden und hat ein weißes Fell.","b":"der Eisbär","image":"adobe_210002344_crop-228-0-3264-3264","sound":"der Eisbär"},{"a":"Es lebt in Australien und kann hoch springen.","b":"das Känguru","image":"adobe_141994706_crop-1402-1027-2803-2803","sound":"das Känguru"},{"a":"Er lebt in China und liebt Bambus.","b":"der Pandabär","image":"adobe_232167177_crop-1283-582-2561-2561","sound":"der Pandabär"}]},{"trainer":"memory","instruction":{"text":"Welches Bild passt zu welchem Satz?","speaker":true},"chooseMode":"image","wideCards":true,"soundMode":"b","atoms":[{"a":"Wenn es brennt, kannst du seine Sirene hören.","b":"das Feuerwehrauto","image":"adobe_281299519_crop-1465-110-1968-1968","sound":"das Feuerwehrauto"},{"a":"Er macht Haufen und schafft sie wieder weg.","b":"der Bagger","image":"adobe_220676590_crop-3488-1050-3103-3103","sound":"der Bagger"},{"a":"Sie fährt Menschen und Material durch das ganze Land.","b":"die Lokomotive","image":"adobe_333164697","sound":"die Lokomotive"},{"a":"Er ist groß, steht rum und dreht sich im Kreis.","b":"der Kran","image":"adobe_244094814","sound":"der Kran"}]},{"trainer":"memory","instruction":{"text":"Welches Bild passt zu welchem Satz?","speaker":true},"chooseMode":"image","wideCards":true,"soundMode":"b","atoms":[{"a":"Du hast dich verlaufen? Immerhin weißt du dank ihm, wo Norden ist.","b":"der Kompass","image":"adobe_257536800_crop-420-0-4000-4000","sound":"der Kompass"},{"a":"Damit erscheinen entfernte Objekte größer.","b":"das Fernglas","image":"adobe_435359333_crop-754-0-3005-3005","sound":"das Fernglas"},{"a":"Wie man sie dreht und wendet, die Zeit läuft nicht schneller.","b":"die Sanduhr","image":"bigstockphoto_96634295","sound":"die Sanduhr"},{"a":"Damit kannst du Abstände messen. Und schöne Kreise malen.","b":"der Zirkel","image":"Adobe_254922","sound":"der Zirkel"}]}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Lesen – Genau lesen","path":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/topic","puid":"c-natdeu-3/5dgag3"},"parentBlock":{"title":"Sätze und Texte genau lesen","path":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-01-saetze-lesen/block","puid":"c-natdeu-3/vrv540"},"mediaFiles":{"sounds":[{"fileId":"sound/de/f5/Welches Bild passt zu welchem Satz?","etag":"0dc9-11577"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/das Fernglas","etag":"def9-6269"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/das Feuerwehrauto","etag":"2c0b-7571"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/das Känguru","etag":"6652-4812"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/der Bagger","etag":"4232-3877"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/der Eisbär","etag":"6db2-4891"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/der Kompass","etag":"93ad-4838"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/der Kran","etag":"4835-3720"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/der Pandabär","etag":"3676-5436"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/der Zirkel","etag":"6a87-4292"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/die Elefanten","etag":"3246-5305"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/die Lokomotive","etag":"6a05-5670"},{"fileId":"sound/de/m3/die Sanduhr","etag":"ee22-4291"}],"svgs":[],"lsgs":[],"images":[{"fileId":"image/Adobe_254922","etag":"849d-28606","originalWidth":767,"originalHeight":500},{"fileId":"image/adobe_141994706_crop-1402-1027-2803-2803","etag":"4a6c-39068","originalWidth":500,"originalHeight":500},{"fileId":"image/adobe_210002344_crop-228-0-3264-3264","etag":"37e3-38419","originalWidth":500,"originalHeight":500},{"fileId":"image/adobe_220676590_crop-3488-1050-3103-3103","etag":"99bf-45410","originalWidth":500,"originalHeight"